---
// main imports
import ArticleLayout from "../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
import MatchCard from "../../components/React/MatchCard";
import '../../styles/global.css';

// La Liga match
import LaLigaLogo from "../../../public/competitions/LaLigaLogo.svg";
import RealMadridLogo from '../../../public/teams/real-madrid.svg'
import OviedoLogo from "../../../public/teams/oviedo.svg";

// swiss super league
import SwissLeagueLogo from "../../../public/competitions/swissleague.svg";
import ThunLogo from "../../../public/teams/fc-thun-logo.svg";
import OpponentLogo from "../../../public/teams/Young-Boys.svg";

// belgium cup
import BelgianCupLogo from "../../../public/competitions/Belgium-Cup.svg";
import UnionLogo from "../../../public/teams/union-saint-gilloise.svg";
import AnderlechtLogo from "../../../public/teams/anderlecht.svg";

// danish cup
import DanishCupLogo from "../../../public/competitions/DBU_Pokalen.svg";
import MidtjyllandLogo from "../../../public/teams/Midtjylland.svg";
import CopenhagenLogo from "../../../public/teams/FC-Copenhagen-1992.svg";

// swedish cup
import SwedishLeagueLogo from "../../../public/competitions/Svenska_Cupen_logo.svg";
import MjallbyLogo from "../../../public/teams/Mjallby.svg";
import HammarbyLogo from "../../../public/teams/hammarby.svg";
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="Superb European Football Roundup - May 14, 2026"
  date="May 14, 2026"
  author="Your Name"
  tags={["roundup", "laliga", "switzerland", "belgium", "denmark", "sweden"]}
>
  <p>
    A wild night of European football with shocks, blowouts, and cup finals
    across the continent!
  </p>

  <hr />
  <!-- 1. REAL MADRID vs OVIEDO PREVIEW -->
  <h2>🇪🇸 La Liga Preview: Real Madrid vs Real Oviedo</h2>
  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="Real Madrid"
    awayTeam="Real Oviedo"
    homeScore={0}
    awayScore={0}
    competition="La Liga - Matchday 36"
    competitionLogo={LaLigaLogo?.src || ""}
    status="UPCOMING"
    homeLogo={RealMadridLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={OviedoLogo?.src || ""}
  />
  <p>
    Real Madrid host Oviedo at the Bernabéu looking to keep their title hopes
    alive. The newly promoted visitors are fighting relegation but face an
    uphill battle against the Galácticos.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Prediction:</strong> Real Madrid 3-0 | <strong>Key Player:</strong> Jude
    Bellingham
  </p>

  <hr />

  <!-- 2. SWISS SUPER LEAGUE: THUN CRUSHED 3-8 -->
  <h2>🇨🇭 Swiss Super League: Champions Thun Humiliated 3-8</h2>
  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="FC Thun"
    awayTeam="Young Boys"
    homeScore={3}
    awayScore={8}
    competition="Swiss Super League"
    competitionLogo={SwissLeagueLogo?.src || ""}
    status="FT"
    homeLogo={ThunLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={OpponentLogo?.src || ""}
  />
  <p>
    What a disaster for the newly crowned champions! Thun's defense completely
    collapsed in a shocking 3-8 loss. The 8 goals conceded is their worst
    defensive performance in over a decade.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>❌ 8 goals conceded at home</li>
    <li>❌ Champions' celebration hangover?</li>
    <li>❌ Biggest loss in club history</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <!-- 3. BELGIAN CUP FINAL: Union SG WIN -->
  <h2>🇧🇪 Belgian Cup Final: Union Saint-Gilloise Triumph Over Anderlecht</h2>
  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="Union SG"
    awayTeam="Anderlecht"
    homeScore={3}
    awayScore={1}
    competition="Belgian Cup - Final"
    competitionLogo={BelgianCupLogo?.src || ""}
    status="AET"
    homeLogo={UnionLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={AnderlechtLogo?.src || ""}
  />
  <p>
    Union Saint-Gilloise lift the Belgian Cup after a hard-fought 2-1 victory
    over rivals Anderlecht. The final was a tense affair with Union's
    never-say-die attitude paying off once again.
  </p>
  <p><strong>🏆 Trophy #2 for Union this season!</strong></p>

  <hr />

  <!-- 4. DANISH CUP FINAL: Midtjylland Deny Copenhagen -->
  <h2>
    🇩🇰 DBU Pokalen Final: Midtjylland Capitalize on Copenhagen's Disastrous
    Season
  </h2>
  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="FC Copenhagen"
    awayTeam="FC Midtjylland"
    homeScore={0}
    awayScore={1}
    competition="DBU Pokalen - Final"
    competitionLogo={DanishCupLogo?.src || ""}
    status="FT"
    homeLogo={CopenhagenLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={MidtjyllandLogo?.src || ""}
  />
  <p>
    FC Copenhagen's nightmare season continues! After failing to win the league,
    they've now lost the cup final to Midtjylland. A trophyless campaign for the
    Danish giants - their worst in recent memory.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>❌ 0 domestic trophies for Copenhagen</li>
    <li>✅ Midtjylland claim silverware</li>
    <li>⚠️ Crisis talks expected at Copenhagen</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <!-- 5. SWEDISH UNDERDOGS: Mjällby Double Over Hammarby -->
  <h2>
    &#127480;&#127466; Svenska Cupen: Underdogs Mjällby Complete Double Over Hammarby in Stockholm
  </h2>
  <MatchCard
    client:load
    homeTeam="Mjällby"
    awayTeam="Hammarby"
    homeScore={2}
    awayScore={1}
    competition="Svenska Cupen"
    competitionLogo={SwedishLeagueLogo?.src || ""}
    status="FT"
    homeLogo={MjallbyLogo?.src || ""}
    awayLogo={HammarbyLogo?.src || ""}
  />
  <p>
    Huge upset in Stockholm! Mjällby, the pre-season underdogs, have done the
    double over Hammarby with a stunning 2-1 away victory. The small-town club
    continues to punch above their weight while the home fans are left stunned.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>✅ Mjällby win both fixtures this season</li>
    <li>⭐ Fairytale season for the underdogs</li>
    <li>😡 Hammarby fans demand answers</li>
  </ul>

  <hr />

  <h3>📅 What a day of Football!</h3>
  <p>
    Cup finals, giant killings, and absolute chaos across Europe. More coverage
    coming soon!
  </p>
</ArticleLayout>
